### Health Check & Database Connection Status
GET http://localhost:5000/health

###

### 1. Get All Tasks (Task.find)
GET http://localhost:5000/tasks

###

### 2. Create Task with Mongoose Schema & Priority Enum (Valid)
POST http://localhost:5000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "  Complete Practical 5 Assignment  ",
  "description": "Integrate MongoDB and Mongoose schema validation",
  "priority": "high",
  "completed": false
}

###

### 3. Create Task with Invalid Priority (Mongoose Enum Validation -> 400 Structured JSON)
POST http://localhost:5000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Invalid Priority Task",
  "priority": "urgent"
}

###

### 4. Create Task Missing Required Title (Mongoose Required Validation -> 400 Structured JSON)
POST http://localhost:5000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Missing title field"
}

###

### 5. Create Task Missing Content-Type Header (415 Unsupported Media Type)
POST http://localhost:5000/tasks

{
  "title": "Missing Header"
}

###

### 6. Get Task by Invalid ObjectId Format (Route Middleware -> 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:5000/tasks/123-invalid-id

###

### 7. Get Task by Non-Existent Valid ObjectId (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:5000/tasks/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011

###

### 8. Update Task (Task.findByIdAndUpdate)
### Replace the ID below with a real ObjectId returned from POST /tasks
PUT http://localhost:5000/tasks/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true,
  "priority": "low"
}

###

### 9. Delete Task (Task.findByIdAndDelete)
### Replace the ID below with a real ObjectId returned from POST /tasks
DELETE http://localhost:5000/tasks/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011

###

### 10. Undefined Endpoint (Custom JSON 404 Handler)
GET http://localhost:5000/undefined-route
